#: ../../source/docs/modules/gasheli.rst:3 5e764152b46d4cc79986419a9d58dbbf
msgid "Gas Helicopter Management"
msgstr "燃油直升机管理"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gasheli.rst:9 23ff8f65994849f1bd1716a8ae59693b
msgid ""
"The gesheli module provides handling for the starting and stopping of gas "
"heli engines that have ignition and starter motor control."
msgstr "gasheli 模块用于处理具有点火和启动电机控制的燃油直升机的启动和停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gasheli.rst:13 ef21acb6bfbf4685931285135127d3a3
msgid ""
"It requires the ignition control on a RC channel and the starter motor on a "
"RC channel."
msgstr "需要在一个 RC 通道上连接点火控制，在另一个 RC 通道上连接启动电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gasheli.rst:17 cb1af5d98477466481e5c0a0333c4c4b
msgid "Start/Stop"
msgstr "启动/停止"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gasheli.rst:23 99769e80616442009dacfbd0b10ced7c
msgid ""
"Begin the start sequence. The starter motor will engage, then the ignition "
"will switch on after ``ignition_disable_time`` sec."
msgstr "开始启动序列。启动电机将接合，随后在 ``ignition_disable_time`` 秒后点火开启。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gasheli.rst:26 98e8919fc8e74361bd0bf292dda7b7a5
msgid "The starter motor will stop after ``starter_time`` sec."
msgstr "启动电机将在 ``starter_time`` 秒后停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gasheli.rst:32 12e315195f6d4a419ffd2d0b197020d2
msgid ""
"Stop the engine. It does this by pulling the ignition channel low. After "
"``ignition_stop_time`` sec it hands back control to the RC transmitter."
msgstr "停止引擎。通过将点火通道拉低实现。``ignition_stop_time`` 秒后将控制权交还给遥控发射机。"

